---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PostRow from '../components/PostRow.astro';
import PortableArt from '../components/PortableArt.astro';
import { posts, articleUrl, tagUrl } from '../lib/posts';
const all = await posts(); const featured = all.find(p => p.data.featured) ?? all[0];
const topics = [...new Set(all.flatMap(p => p.data.tags))];
---
<Layout>
<section class="intro page-width"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> 一个独立的数字角落</div><h1>把问题弄懂，<br class="mobile-break"/>把方法<span class="ink-underline">留下。</span></h1><p>记录技术实践、好用的工具，以及值得反复思考的事。<br/>不急着给答案，先把每一步说清楚。</p><div class="intro-foot"><span>HOW DO I …</span><span>从一个问题，开始一次探索 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></span></div></section>
<div class="page-width home-grid"><div class="main-column">
{featured && <section class="featured"><div class="featured-copy"><div class="eyebrow">编辑精选 <span class="small-rule"></span> {featured.data.example ? '示例文章' : '推荐阅读'}</div><h2><a href={articleUrl(featured)}>{featured.data.title}</a></h2><p>{featured.data.description}</p><a class="text-link" href={articleUrl(featured)}>打开这篇文章 <span>↗</span></a></div><a class="art-link" href={articleUrl(featured)} aria-label={`阅读：${featured.data.title}`}><PortableArt/></a></section>}
<section class="latest"><div class="section-heading"><h2>最近更新<span> / FIELD NOTES</span></h2><a href="/articles/">全部文章 <span>↗</span></a></div>{all.slice(0,5).map(post => <PostRow post={post}/>)}{!all.length && <p class="empty-state">第一篇文章正在整理中。先从一个想弄懂的问题开始。</p>}<a class="archive-link" href="/articles/">去文章归档，慢慢翻 <span>→</span></a></section>
</div><aside class="sidebar"><section class="side-note"><span class="note-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h2>你好，这里是 howdo。</h2><p>一个用来把问题讲清楚的地方。<br/>写下过程，也留下判断的依据。</p><a href="/about/">关于这个博客 <span>↗</span></a><div class="note-bottom">保持好奇，认真记录。</div></section><section class="topic-section"><div class="side-heading"><h2>按主题探索</h2><span>TOPICS</span></div><div class="topic-list">{topics.map((tag,i) => <a href={tagUrl(tag)}><span><span class="topic-number">0{i+1}</span>{tag}</span><span class="topic-count">{all.filter(p=>p.data.tags.includes(tag)).length} <span>↗</span></span></a>)}</div></section><a class="rss-card" href="/rss.xml"><span class="rss-icon" aria-hidden="true">◔</span><div><strong>让更新来找你</strong><span>通过 RSS，按自己的节奏阅读。</span></div><span>↗</span></a><p class="sidebar-caption">文字在这里生长。<br/>内容由 Markdown 书写。</p></aside></div>
</Layout>
